      "title": "Welcome to Folio",
      "icon": "✨",
      "cover": "sky",
      "content": "<h2>Notion-style notebooks, right in one file</h2><p>Tap into the title or body to reveal the formatting toolbar with <span data-tc=\"blue\">Notion text colors</span> and <span data-bc=\"yellow\">highlight colors</span>.</p><div class=\"callout-block\" data-bc=\"blue\"><span class=\"callout-icon\" contenteditable=\"false\">💡</span><div class=\"callout-body\">Type <code>/</code> anywhere to open the slash command menu, including <code>/page</code>, <code>/image</code>, or <code>/date</code>.</div></div><h3>Nested Sub-pages</h3><p><a class=\"subpage-link\" data-page-id=\"page_roadmap\" href=\"#page_roadmap\" contenteditable=\"false\"><span class=\"subpage-link-icon\">🗺️</span><span class=\"subpage-link-title\">Q4 Product Roadmap</span></a></p><div class=\"toggle-block open\"><div class=\"toggle-header\"><span class=\"toggle-arrow\" contenteditable=\"false\">▶</span><span class=\"toggle-summary\">Keyboard shortcuts &amp; tips</span></div><div class=\"toggle-content\">Press Ctrl/Cmd+K to quick-search, Ctrl/Cmd+N for a new page, or drag pages in the tree to reorder and nest them.</div></div>",
